    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This charming two-bedroom, two-bathroom detached countryside cottage c. 66.86 m2 just minutes from Ballylanders Village, offering peace, privacy, scenic rural living, yet close to all local amenities. This property is suitable for 1st time buyers / downsizers / holiday home seekers looking for a easily maintained two-bedroom layout in a strong community and close to stunning hiking routes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch:  \t1.67 m x 2.62 m.\r\n\r\nLivingroom: \t\t3.67 m x 4.97 m. \r\n\r\nKitchen:\t\t\t3.05 m x 2.90 m.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\t\t\t2.08 m x 1.92 m. \r\n\r\nHall / Utility:\t\t1.34 m x 1.91 m.\r\n\r\n\r\n1st Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\t\t3.22 m x 3.51 m.\r\n\r\nEn-suite:\t\t\t1.89 m x 1.09 m.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\t\t3.45 m x 3.71 m.\r\n\r\n\r\nEnergy efficient upgrades:\r\n\r\nTreble glazing on all windows and doors.\r\nPalladio front door.\r\nUnderfloor P.I.R. insulation at ground floor\r\n50 mm insulation on upstairs ceilings over an airtightness membrane.\r\nFront porch has external 100mm insulation fitted.\r\nPatio floor also insulated.\r\nLow wattage energy efficient lighting and appliances fitted.\r\nDual central heating system-outdoor heatpac boiler & solid fuel stove with boiler."
      },
